### Healthcheck
GET {{base_url}}/health

### Readiness
GET {{base_url}}/ready

### Métricas Prometheus
# Inclui as métricas do pool de conexões do banco (go_sql_*): open/in_use/idle,
# wait_count_total e wait_duration_seconds_total (evidência de exaustão de pool — F26).
GET {{base_url}}/metrics

### pprof — índice (requer PPROF_ENABLED=true e login admin)
# Profiles de runtime para investigar gargalos fora do banco (F26).
GET {{base_url}}/debug/pprof/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### pprof — heap (snapshot de memória)
GET {{base_url}}/debug/pprof/heap
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### pprof — goroutines
GET {{base_url}}/debug/pprof/goroutine?debug=1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### pprof — CPU profile (30s; cuidado em produção)
GET {{base_url}}/debug/pprof/profile?seconds=30
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
